1b:T47d,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://pulse.smatchroom.com/agent-ia/agent-ia-sdr-vs-humain#webpage","url":"https://pulse.smatchroom.com/agent-ia/agent-ia-sdr-vs-humain","name":"Agent IA SDR vs SDR humain : quel ROI réel pour PME B2B ?","description":"Comparez le ROI d'un agent IA SDR vs un SDR humain. Découvrez pourquoi l'IA devient rentable dès le 2e-3e mois pour votre PME B2B.","inLanguage":"fr-FR","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://pulse.smatchroom.com/#website"},"about":{"@id":"https://pulse.smatchroom.com/#organization"},"breadcrumb":{"@id":"https://pulse.smatchroom.com/agent-ia/agent-ia-sdr-vs-humain#breadcrumb"}},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Accueil","item":"https://pulse.smatchroom.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Ressources agent IA","item":"https://pulse.smatchroom.com/agent-ia"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Agent IA SDR vs SDR humain : quel ROI réel ?","item":"https://pulse.smatchroom.com/agent-ia/agent-ia-sdr-vs-humain"}],"@id":"https://pulse.smatchroom.com/agent-ia/agent-ia-sdr-vs-humain#breadcrumb"}]}12:[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$1b"}}],["$","$L1c",null,{}],["$","article",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 prose prose-invert","children":[["$","nav",null,{"className":"text-sm text-neutral-400 mb-6","children":[["$","$L1d",null,{"href":"/","children":"Accueil"}]," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"mx-2","children":"›"}],["$","$L1d",null,{"href":"/agent-ia","children":"Agent IA"}]," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"mx-2","children":"›"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Agent IA SDR vs SDR humain : quel ROI réel ?"}]]}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight mb-4","children":"Agent IA SDR vs SDR humain : quel ROI réel ?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-neutral-400 mb-12","children":["Publié le ","23/05/2026"," · ",12," min de lecture"," · ",["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono","children":"agent ia sdr roi"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-body","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":["Pour une PME B2B, le ROI d'un ",["$","a",null,{"href":"/solutions/agent-sdr","children":"agent IA SDR"}]," devient positif en général dès le 2e ou 3e mois d'exploitation. Un SDR humain coûte entre 45 000 € et 65 000 € par an (salaire brut + charges), sans compter l'onboarding ni le turnover. Un agent IA SDR revient à moins de 10 000 € annuels tout compris. L'écart de coût est structurel, pas conjoncturel."]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"id":"ce-que-coûte-réellement-un-sdr-humain-vs-un-agent-ia-sdr","children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#ce-que-coûte-réellement-un-sdr-humain-vs-un-agent-ia-sdr","children":"Ce que coûte réellement un SDR humain vs un agent IA SDR"}]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"id":"le-coût-total-dun-sdr-humain--bien-au-delà-du-salaire-affiché","children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#le-coût-total-dun-sdr-humain--bien-au-delà-du-salaire-affiché","children":"Le coût total d'un SDR humain : bien au-delà du salaire affiché"}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Le salaire brut d'un SDR junior en France se situe entre 28 000 € et 38 000 € par an. Ajoutez les charges patronales (environ 45 %), et la base atteint déjà 40 000 à 55 000 €. Mais ce n'est que le point de départ."}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Les coûts indirects souvent sous-estimés :"}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Onboarding et formation"}]," : 4 à 8 semaines de montée en compétences, soit 8 000 à 15 000 € de productivité perdue selon les estimations sectorielles"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Stack outillage"}]," : CRM, outil de séquençage, enrichissement de données — entre 3 000 € et 6 000 € par an par poste"]}],"\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n"]}],"\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d","\n","$L2e","\n","$L2f","\n","$L30","\n","$L31","\n","$L32","\n","$L33","\n","$L34","\n","$L35","\n","$L36","\n","$L37","\n","$L38","\n","$L39","\n","$L3a","\n","$L3b","\n","$L3c","\n","$L3d","\n","$L3e","\n","$L3f","\n","$L40","\n","$L41","\n","$L42","\n","$L43","\n","$L44","\n","$L45","\n","$L46","\n","$L47","\n","$L48","\n","$L49","\n","$L4a","\n","$L4b","\n","$L4c","\n","$L4d","\n","$L4e","\n","$L4f","\n","$L50","\n","$L51","\n","$L52","\n","$L53","\n","$L54","\n","$L55","\n","$L56","\n","$L57","\n","$L58","\n","$L59","\n","$L5a","\n","$L5b","\n","$L5c","\n","$L5d","\n","$L5e","\n","$L5f","\n","$L60","\n","$L61","\n","$L62","\n","$L63","\n","$L64","\n","$L65","\n","$L66","\n","$L67","\n","$L68","\n","$L69","\n","$L6a","\n","$L6b","\n","$L6c","\n","$L6d","\n","$L6e","\n","$L6f"]}],"$L70","$L71","$L72","$L73"]}],"$L74"]
